    <data key="d0">MyTona In-Game Purchase Recommendation System</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Recommendation system architecture with dynamic traffic allocation (MAB) and automated SageMaker model training workflow.</data>
    <data key="d3">Machine Learning, Game Infrastructure</data>
